# deploy/docker/Dockerfile.copilot — Dockerfile de PRODUCAO do copiloto
# (Python/LangGraph, services/copilot). Nao existia Dockerfile de producao
# para este servico ate o E8 (mandato item 4 — supply chain).
#
# Multi-stage: builder resolve as dependencias do pyproject.toml (runtime
# apenas — sem o extra [dev] de pytest/ruff/mypy) em virtualenv isolado;
# o estagio final e slim, nonroot, sem toolchain de build nem segredo
# (§2.7 — segredos vem do OpenBao/Vault Agent em runtime, nunca da imagem).
#
# Usado por .github/workflows/supply-chain.yml (build -> SBOM -> Trivy ->
# cosign sign keyless -> push ghcr.io/hojex/copilot).
#
# Uso (contexto = services/copilot/, NAO a raiz do repo):
#   docker build -f deploy/docker/Dockerfile.copilot \
#     --build-arg REVISION="$(git rev-parse HEAD)" \
#     -t ghcr.io/hojex/copilot:v1.2.3 services/copilot

FROM python:3.12-slim AS build
WORKDIR /src

# Copia so o necessario para a resolucao de dependencias via
# [tool.setuptools.packages.find] (pyproject.toml) — tests/ e
# adserver_copilot.egg-info ficam de fora da imagem de producao.
COPY pyproject.toml ./
COPY app ./app
COPY graph ./graph
COPY guardrails ./guardrails
COPY rag ./rag
COPY observability ./observability
COPY tools ./tools

RUN python -m venv /opt/venv
ENV PATH="/opt/venv/bin:$PATH"

# Apenas dependencias de runtime (sem [dev]: pytest/ruff/mypy ficam de fora).
RUN pip install --no-cache-dir --upgrade pip && \
    pip install --no-cache-dir .

# Estagio final: slim (sem toolchain de compilacao), usuario nao-root
# explicito (python:3.12-slim nao traz "nonroot" pronto como o distroless).
FROM python:3.12-slim AS runtime

ARG REVISION=unknown
LABEL org.opencontainers.image.title="adserver-copilot" \
      org.opencontainers.image.source="https://github.com/hojexnews/AdServer" \
      org.opencontainers.image.revision="${REVISION}" \
      org.opencontainers.image.vendor="Hojex" \
      org.opencontainers.image.licenses="UNLICENSED" \
      org.opencontainers.image.description="AdServer Copilot Gateway (LangGraph + FastAPI, J5/Fase 2) — imagem de producao, nonroot, sem segredo estatico."

RUN groupadd --system --gid 65532 nonroot \
    && useradd --system --uid 65532 --gid nonroot --no-create-home --shell /usr/sbin/nologin nonroot

COPY --from=build /opt/venv /opt/venv
ENV PATH="/opt/venv/bin:$PATH" \
    PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1 \
    PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1

WORKDIR /app
COPY --from=build /src/app ./app
COPY --from=build /src/graph ./graph
COPY --from=build /src/guardrails ./guardrails
COPY --from=build /src/rag ./rag
COPY --from=build /src/observability ./observability
COPY --from=build /src/tools ./tools

USER nonroot:nonroot
# Porta default do FastAPI (services/copilot/app/config.py: port=8001).
EXPOSE 8001
ENTRYPOINT ["uvicorn", "app.server:app", "--host", "0.0.0.0", "--port", "8001"]
